*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Contoso's PostScript printer description, read by Windows' PostScript class driver (MSxpsPS.dll)
*% through contoso-manifest.ini. Written from Adobe's PPD File Format Specification 4.3 and Microsoft's
*% v4 printer driver PPD keywords. A virtual printer has no hardware margins: every page size's
*% imageable area is the whole sheet, so a program that clips to the printable area clips nothing.

*FileVersion: "1.0"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*Manufacturer: "Contoso"
*ModelName: "Contoso PostScript Driver"
*NickName: "Contoso PostScript Driver"
*ShortNickName: "Contoso PostScript Driver"
*Product: "(Contoso)"
*PCFileName: "CONTOSO.PPD"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"

*MSIsXPSDriver: True
*MSXPSMaxCopies: "999"
*MSPrintSchemaPrivateNamespaceURI: "http://schemas.contoso.example/printing/contoso-ps"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 PageSetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi: "<< /HWResolution [600 600] >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% The sizes, each with its imageable area the whole sheet.
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 PageSetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [595 842] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageSize Letter: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [612 792] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageSize Legal: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [612 1008] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageSize A3: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [842 1191] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageSize A5: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [420 595] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 PageSetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [595 842] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageRegion Letter: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [612 792] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageRegion Legal: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [612 1008] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageRegion A3: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [842 1191] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*PageRegion A5: "featurebegin{<< /PageSize [420 595] >> setpagedevice}featurecleanup"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea A3: "0 0 842 1191"
*ImageableArea A5: "0 0 420 595"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A3: "842 1191"
*PaperDimension A5: "420 595"

*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*RequiresPageRegion All: True

*OpenUI *PageOrientation: PickOne
*DefaultPageOrientation: Portrait
*PageOrientation Portrait: ""
*PageOrientation Landscape: ""
*CloseUI: *PageOrientation
*MSPrintSchemaKeywordMap: PageOrientation *PageOrientation
*MSPrintSchemaKeywordMap: PageOrientation Portrait *PageOrientation Portrait
*MSPrintSchemaKeywordMap: PageOrientation Landscape *PageOrientation Landscape
